Business </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Value, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Custom </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Object </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Data </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Model, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Flow </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Architecture</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">என்று </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">தனித்தனி </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">headings-ஆக </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">வர, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Markdown </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">format-ல் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">paste </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">பண்ண </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">வேண்டும்.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">கீழே </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">இருக்கிற </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">content-ஐ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">முழுவதுமாக </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">copy </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">செய்து </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">README.md</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">editor-ல் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">paste </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">பண்ணுங்க.</span></p><div><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] frame-aD2tvA editorControls-fA0_fZ z-10 clear-both my-4 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:my-0 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overflow-y-auto in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overscroll-contain in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:scrollbar-none [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--codex-base-accent,var(--color-text-info,var(--color-text)))] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-primary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-info-solid,var(--color-text-inverse,#fff))] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="# Support Ticket Priority Prediction and Automated Assignment System Using Agentforce

## 1. Project Overview

This project presents an intelligent support ticket management system built on the Salesforce platform. It automates ticket priority classification, assigns high-priority tasks, and streamlines agent workflows using Salesforce Autolaunched Flows and Agentforce AI Agent configurations.

## 2. Business Value &amp; Key Objectives

- **Faster Ticket Resolution:** Prioritizes critical issues automatically.
- **Reduced Manual Effort:** Replaces manual ticket review with automated logic.
- **Intelligent Workload Management:** Assigns high-priority tickets to suitable support agents.

## 3. Custom Object Data Model

**Object Name:** Support Ticket Intelligence

**API Name:** `Support_Ticket_Intelligence__c`

| Field Label | API Name | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| Ticket Number | `Ticket_Number__c` | Auto Number | TKT-{0000} |
| Customer | `Customer__c` | Lookup (Account) | Related Account |
| Contact | `Contact__c` | Lookup (Contact) | Customer Contact |
| Issue Type | `Issue_Type__c` | Picklist | Technical, Billing, General |
| Description | `Description__c` | Long Text Area | Issue details |
| Priority Level | `Priority_Level__c` | Picklist | Low, Medium, High |
| Status | `Status__c` | Picklist | New, In Progress, Resolved |
| Created Date | `Created_Date__c` | Date | Ticket Date |
| Assigned To | `Assigned_To__c` | Lookup (User) | Support Agent |
| SLA Breach Risk | `SLA_Breach_Risk__c` | Checkbox | Risk Flag |

## 4. Flow Architecture &amp; Automation Logic

**Flow Type:** Auto-Launched Flow integrated with Agentforce.

1. **Get Account Records:** Fetches account details using `varAccountName`.
2. **Get Support Ticket:** Retrieves the relevant support ticket associated with the account.
3. **Keyword Analysis:** Classifies tickets based on description keywords.
   - **High Priority:** &quot;urgent&quot;, &quot;not working&quot;, or &quot;failure&quot;.
   - **Medium Priority:** &quot;issue&quot;, &quot;slow&quot;, or &quot;delay&quot;.
   - **Low Priority:** Default fallback category.
4. **Action &amp; Task Assignment:**
   - Creates a high-priority follow-up task when a high-priority ticket is detected.
   - Sets output variables such as `varPriorityLevel`, `varAssignedTo`, and `varActionMessage`.

## 5. Agentforce AI Configuration

- **Topic Label:** Support Ticket Priority Analysis
- **API Name:** `Support_Ticket_Priority_Analysis`
- **Classification:** Analyzes support ticket details, identifies urgency, and triggers Flow automation.
- **Agent Action:** `Support_Ticket_Intelligence_c`
- **Reference Flow:** `Support_Ticket_Intellegence`
- **Input Parameter:** `varAccountName`
- **Output Parameters:** `varAccountId`, `varTicketId`, `varPriorityLevel`, `varAssignedTo`, `varActionMessage`

## 6. Proof of Functionality &amp; Screenshots

### 6.1 Flow Debug Proof Log

![Flow Debug Proof](Flow_Debug_Proof.png)

### 6.2 Support Ticket Intelligence Records Page

![Ticket Records Page](Ticket_Records_page.png)

## 7. Project Status

- **Salesforce Custom Object &amp; Fields:** Completed and verified.
- **Auto-Launched Flow Logic:** Completed, debugged, and tested.
- **Agentforce Integration:** Designed and configured as implemented in the project.

## 8. Conclusion

This project uses Salesforce Flow and Agentforce to improve ticket prioritization, automate support workflows, and help support teams handle critical customer issues efficiently.
