்கு </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">உண்மையான </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">proof </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">வேண்டுமென்றால், </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">உன்னுடைய </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Salesforce </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Flow </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Debug </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">successful </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">result </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">screenshot-ஐப் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">பயன்படுத்துவது </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">சிறந்தது.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">நீ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">இப்போ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">GitHub-ல் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">இருக்கியா, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">அல்லது </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Salesforce-ல் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">இருக்கியா? </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">அதைப் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">பொறுத்து </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">அடுத்த </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">click-ஐச் </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">சொல்றேன்.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electro